The SEG-X3 gateway acts as a central platform of your entire smart home system. It is equipped with ZigBee and Wi-Fi communication that connects all smart ZigBee devices in one central place, allowing you to control all the ZigBee devices remotely through the mobile app.

## Key Features

- ZigBee 3.0
- ZigBee coordinator of the home area network
- Powerful CPU for complicated calculation
- Real time and efficiently interoperability with cloud server
- Open Server API and Gateway API for third-party cloud server and mobile app integration
